        <span>Windows 10/11 • AArch64</span><span class="text-[#5865f2]">✦</span>
        <span>macOS 12+ • Apple Silicon</span><span class="text-[#67e8f9]">✦</span>
        <span>Linux • Wayland • X11</span><span class="text-[#a78bfa]">✦</span>
        <span>Themes • Transparency</span><span class="text-emerald-300">✦</span>
